    "updated_at": "2024-04-02T13:42:41Z",
    "body": "This is a good change -- it should be possible to use `modulepreload` to load all the components of an ESM graph.\r\n\r\nCurrently `modulepreload` is a subset of `preload`, however there is no use case for `preload as=json` so it makes sense to only support JSON in `modulepreload`.",
